<h2>Paid for by time saved (assumed example below)</h2>
<p class="calc">Assume 200 home support workers, 20 manager queries a day, 70% routine, 6 minutes each, 25 working days. That is about 35 manager hours a month, roughly €1,050 at an assumed €30 an hour. At an assumed €400 a month, the net saving could be about €650 a month.</p>

<h2>How people cope today</h2>
<p>It is assumed, at the time of posting, that management teams continue to field several phone calls per day from care staff to query whether select tasks are permitted or not. Using this tool is expected to reduce management workload and give home support workers (HSWs) on the front line more consistent response times. Managers would only handle exceptions, reducing the admin burden while maintaining human oversight.</p>
